  {
   "id": "legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -780,
   "width": 800,
   "height": 360,
   "text": "**Timeline**\n\nEach box spans a lifetime (left edge = birth). Lanes = grandparent sides.\n\nColoured = direct ancestor (green documented · cyan strong inference · yellow family compilation · orange compiled lead · red unresolved). Grey = relative, not an ancestor.\n\nEstimated dates (fl., c., centuries) are approximate. Living people are never shown. Events along the top. A few links cross lanes where one ancestor appears on two sides (see Double ancestors).\n\nRebuild: `python3 _System/tools/timeline.py`"
  }
